+The local Nix patch keeps the microphone indicator visible during this grace
+period. Startup stays cold in Release when idle mode. Selecting that mode while
+idle releases immediately; a cancelled pending open still closes immediately.
+Keep ready and Commands retain continuous capture. Timer boundary/reset tests
+in `microphone_idle.rs` run without Apple frameworks. The owner regression in
+`dictation_audio.rs` covers a cancelled cold open, restart, finish, and delayed
+stream closure. Native microphone and Settings preview verification still
+require the macOS build toolchain.
+
